---
import RootLayout from "../layouts/RootLayout.astro";
---

<RootLayout title="JurisAI — Inteligência Artificial Jurídica Corporativa">
  <header id="main-header" class="fixed top-4 left-4 right-4 mx-auto max-w-5xl z-50 bg-[#F9F9FB]/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-200/60 rounded-full apple-pill shadow-md transition-all duration-300 origin-top">
    <div class="px-6 sm:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
        </svg>
        <span class="font-apple-display font-bold tracking-tight text-sm text-primary">JurisAI</span>
      </div>
      <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary">
        <a href="#features" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors font-apple-text py-2">Soluções</a>
        <a href="#governanca" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors font-apple-text py-2">Privacidade</a>
        <a href="#precos" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors font-apple-text py-2">Preços</a>
      </nav>
      <a href="/app/auth" data-magnetic class="cta-link bg-primary text-white font-semibold text-[11px] px-4 min-h-[44px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-full apple-pill hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors shadow-xs font-apple-text">
        Iniciar Teste
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content" class="w-full bg-background pt-16 overflow-hidden">
    
    <section id="hero-trigger" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-20 sm:pt-32 pb-16 sm:pb-24 relative grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-x-24 lg:gap-y-6 items-center">
      
      <div id="hero-backlight" class="absolute w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-radial from-slate-200/40 via-slate-100/10 to-transparent blur-3xl pointer-events-none z-0 left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></div>

      <!-- Bloco A: Tag + Título -->
      <div class="z-10 relative text-left lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-2 lg:row-start-1 lg:row-end-2">
        <span data-anim="hero-tag" class="inline-block text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary bg-white border border-border shadow-xs px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full apple-pill mb-6 font-apple-text">
          Inteligência Artificial Premium
        </span>
        <h1 data-anim="hero-title" class="apple-text-sheen font-apple-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[62px] tracking-[-0.05em] leading-[1.05] text-primary">
          A inteligência artificial que lê, analisa e redige seus documentos jurídicos.
        </h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Bloco B: Cinema Video Box -->
      <div id="video-reveal-container" class="z-10 relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end w-full lg:col-start-2 lg:col-end-3 lg:row-start-1 lg:row-end-3 self-center">
        <div class="apple-video-hardware-card w-full max-w-xl aspect-[16/10] bg-white rounded-[32px] border border-border shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden p-1.5 bg-slate-50">
          <div class="w-full h-full rounded-[26px] apple-video-inner overflow-hidden relative">
            <video 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover scale-102" 
              autoplay 
              muted 
              loop 
              playsinline 
              preload="auto"
            >
              <source src="/div.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
              <p class="text-xs text-secondary p-4">Seu navegador não suporta vídeos incorporados.</p>
            </video>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-white/10 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bloco C: Descrição + CTAs -->
      <div class="z-10 relative text-left lg:col-start-1 lg:col-end-2 lg:row-start-2 lg:row-end-3">
        <p data-anim="hero-sub" class="mt-4 lg:mt-6 font-apple-text font-normal text-secondary text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          Com precisão matemática, audite minutas, elabore peças fundamentadas e organize provas de forma instantânea. Integrado perfeitamente à sua rotina, sem alterar em nada o seu fluxo de trabalho atual.
        </p>
        <div data-anim="hero-cta" class="mt-8 lg:mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6">
          <a href="/app/auth" data-magnetic class="cta-link bg-primary text-white font-semibold text-xs px-7 min-h-[46px] flex items-center justify-center rounded-full apple-pill hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all shadow-xs font-apple-text">
            Testar grátis por 7 dias
          </a>
          <a href="#features" class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-4 flex items-center min-h-[44px] px-2 gap-1 font-apple-text">
            Conhecer soluções →
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-3 pl-1 font-apple-text">Não exigimos cartão de crédito para o período de testes.</p>
      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- Seção 1: O Manifesto Tipográfico -->
    <section class="w-full bg-[#F9F9FB] py-36 sm:py-44 px-4 sm:px-6 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center border-t border-slate-200/40">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto z-10">
        <h2 class="apple-text-sheen font-apple-display font-bold text-4xl sm:text-7xl tracking-[-0.05em] leading-[1.05] text-primary">
          A complexidade jurídica resolvida com elegância matemática.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-8 font-apple-text font-normal text-secondary text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Não criamos apenas ferramentas de automação. Projetamos sistemas cognitivos de alta precisão que funcionam como extensões intelectuais do seu escritório, convertendo a sobrecarga processual em clareza estratégica.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Seção 2: Linha de Produtos (Apple Lineup Style) -->
    <section id="features" class="border-t border-slate-200/50 bg-white py-24 sm:py-32">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-20 sm:mb-24">
          <h2 class="apple-text-sheen font-apple-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-5xl tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[1.1] text-primary">
            Três soluções de alta precisão desenvolvidas para eliminar a burocracia jurídica do seu dia a dia.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 sm:gap-16">
          
          <!-- Produto 01: Análise de Contratos -->
          <div data-engine="1" class="interactive-engine-card active apple-hardware-card p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 transition-all cursor-pointer">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
              
              <!-- Coluna Texto -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase">01 / CONTRATOS</span>
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs border border-slate-100 laser-icon-wrapper shrink-0">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                  <h3 class="font-apple-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl tracking-[-0.04em] text-primary leading-[1.1]">Análise de Contratos com IA</h3>
                  <p class="font-apple-display font-semibold text-lg text-slate-700 leading-normal">Encontre riscos escondidos em qualquer minuta antes de assinar.</p>
                  <p class="apple-proximity-text font-apple-text font-normal text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    O sistema analisa integralmente o documento e aponta de forma clara e imediata se houver alguma cláusula de risco ou passivo perigoso escondido na redação, protegendo seu escritório contra surpresas jurídicas.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Coluna Visual Mockup -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center lg:justify-end w-full">
                <div class="bg-slate-50/80 rounded-[24px] apple-mockup-card p-6 border border-slate-100 max-w-sm w-full shadow-xs flex flex-col gap-4">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-3 w-full">
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-400 font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase">contrato_servicos.docx</span>
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-300"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-full">
                    <div class="w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-200/80 rounded-full"></div>
                    <div class="w-4/5 h-1.5 bg-slate-200/80 rounded-full"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bg-red-50/40 border border-red-100 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 relative w-full">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 w-full">
                      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[8px] font-bold text-red-600 bg-red-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full apple-pill uppercase tracking-wider font-apple-text shrink-0">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                        Risco Grave
                      </span>
                      <span class="text-[8px] font-semibold text-slate-400 font-apple-text shrink-0">Cláusula 12.4</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-apple-text text-[10px] text-red-900 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                      "Multa rescisória de 40% sobre o saldo total pendente..."
                    </p>
                    <div class="text-[9px] font-semibold text-slate-500 font-apple-text bg-white/90 p-2 rounded-lg border border-red-100/30 flex items-center gap-1.5 w-full">
                      <span class="shrink-0">⚠️</span>
                      <span class="leading-normal">Abusividade: Excede a razoabilidade estipulada pelo CDC e jurisprudência do STJ.</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-full">
                    <div class="w-5/6 h-1.5 bg-slate-200/80 rounded-full"></div>
                    <div class="w-2/3 h-1.5 bg-slate-200/80 rounded-full"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Produto 02: Criador de Petições (Asymmetric Alternated Layout) -->
          <div data-engine="2" class="interactive-engine-card apple-hardware-card p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 transition-all cursor-pointer">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
              
              <!-- Coluna Visual Mockup (On left for desktop) -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-5 order-last lg:order-first flex justify-center lg:justify-start">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center relative w-full max-w-sm h-56">
                  <!-- Anotação Bruta -->
                  <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-[20px] apple-mockup-card-small p-4 border border-slate-200/60 shadow-xs max-w-[170px] w-full space-y-2.5 rotate-[-4deg] z-10 absolute left-4 sm:left-8 top-4 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-300">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-2">
                      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
                      <span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-slate-400 font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase">notas_caso.txt</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-apple-text text-[9px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed italic">
                      "O cliente trabalhou 3 anos sem receber horas extras, fazia duas horas a mais por dia e a empresa nunca pagou..."
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <!-- Petição Estruturada -->
                  <div class="bg-white rounded-[24px] apple-mockup-card p-5 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md max-w-[210px] w-full space-y-3.5 rotate-[4deg] z-20 absolute right-4 sm:right-8 bottom-4 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-300">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
                      <span class="text-[8px] font-bold text-accent font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase">peca_inicial.pdf</span>
                      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-[9px] font-apple-text text-primary">
                      <div class="font-bold text-[7px] text-slate-400 uppercase">Art. 319 do CPC</div>
                      <div class="font-bold border-l-2 border-primary pl-2 my-1">I. DOS FATOS</div>
                      <p class="text-[8px] text-slate-500 leading-normal">
                        "O Reclamante laborou sob regime de sobrejornada habitual, extrapolando..."
                      </p>
                      <div class="font-bold border-l-2 border-primary pl-2 my-1">II. DO DIREITO</div>
                      <div class="font-bold border-l-2 border-primary pl-2 my-1">III. DOS PEDIDOS</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Coluna Texto -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase">02 / REDAÇÃO</span>
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs border border-slate-100 laser-icon-wrapper shrink-0">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.862 4.487l1.687-1.688a1.875 1.875 0 112.652 2.652L6.832 19.82a4.5 4.5 0 01-1.897 1.13l-2.685.8.8-2.685a4.5 4.5 0 011.13-1.897L16.863 4.487zm0 0L19.5 7.125" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                  <h3 class="font-apple-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl tracking-[-0.04em] text-primary leading-[1.1]">Criador de Petições</h3>
                  <p class="font-apple-display font-semibold text-lg text-slate-700 leading-normal">Transforme uma simples anotação em uma peça jurídica completa.</p>
                  <p class="apple-proximity-text font-apple-text font-normal text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    A partir de um breve relato do caso ou notas de áudio, nossa inteligência constrói uma peça de alta qualidade técnica, perfeitamente estruturada nos moldes da lei e pronta para o protocolo.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Produto 03: Organizador de Provas -->
          <div data-engine="3" class="interactive-engine-card apple-hardware-card p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 transition-all cursor-pointer">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
              
              <!-- Coluna Texto -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase">03 / INSTRUÇÃO</span>
                  <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs border border-slate-100 laser-icon-wrapper shrink-0">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                  <h3 class="font-apple-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl tracking-[-0.04em] text-primary leading-[1.1]">Organizador de Provas</h3>
                  <p class="font-apple-display font-semibold text-lg text-slate-700 leading-normal">Transforme conversas de WhatsApp e arquivos em uma linha do tempo clara.</p>
                  <p class="apple-proximity-text font-apple-text font-normal text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    A inteligência artificial organiza o caos de capturas de tela, áudios e arquivos anexados. O sistema gera uma linha do tempo cronológica incontestável e aponta exatamente onde a parte contrária está mentindo.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Coluna Visual Mockup -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
                <div class="bg-slate-50/80 rounded-[24px] apple-mockup-card p-6 border border-slate-100 max-w-sm w-full shadow-xs space-y-4">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-3">
                    <span class="text-[9px] font-bold text-slate-400 font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase">linha_tempo_provas.exe</span>
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-300"></span>
                  </div>
                  
                  <div class="space-y-3">
                    <!-- WhatsApp Bubble -->
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-start space-y-1">
                      <div class="bg-white text-slate-800 rounded-xl rounded-tl-none p-3 max-w-[240px] border border-slate-200/40 shadow-xs">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center gap-4 mb-1">
                          <span class="font-bold text-[8px] text-slate-500 font-apple-text">WhatsApp (Réu)</span>
                          <span class="text-[7px] text-slate-400 font-apple-text">14/03 14:22</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="font-apple-text text-[9px] text-slate-700 leading-normal">
                          "Eu nunca recebi essa mercadoria em mãos e não assinei nenhum papel."
                        </p>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Timeline Match/Contradiction Alert -->
                    <div class="bg-red-50/40 border border-red-100 rounded-xl p-3 space-y-2 relative ml-4">
                      <div class="absolute -left-[14px] top-4 w-2 h-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full border-2 border-white"></div>
                      
                      <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[8px] font-bold text-red-600 bg-red-50 bg-red-50/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full apple-pill uppercase tracking-wider font-apple-text">
                          Inconsistência
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-[7px] font-semibold text-slate-400 font-apple-text">Fato #04</span>
                      </div>
                      
                      <div class="text-[9px] text-red-950 font-apple-text leading-relaxed">
                        <strong>Conflito:</strong> A assinatura digital do autor consta no comprovante de entrega no dia 14/03 às 10:15h.
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Seção 3: O Cofre de Governança (Apple Privacy Style) -->
    <section id="governanca" class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-white border-t border-slate-200/50 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
        
        <!-- Header da Governança -->
        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-20 sm:mb-28">
          <span class="inline-block text-[10px] font-bold text-accent bg-accent/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full apple-pill uppercase tracking-wider font-apple-text mb-4">
            Confiança e Privacidade
          </span>
          <h2 class="apple-text-sheen font-apple-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-5xl tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[1.1] text-primary">
            Privacidade absoluta. O sigilo do seu escritório blindado por padrão.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <!-- Prateleiras Verticais de Confiança Assimétricas (Apple Trust Lineup) -->
        <div class="border-t border-slate-200/80 pt-12 space-y-12 lg:space-y-16">
          
          <!-- Pilar 1: Confidencialidade (Asset Esq / Texto Dir) -->
          <div class="governanca-shelf apple-hardware-card p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-center">
              <!-- Asset Container (60%) -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-7 apple-glass-image-card relative overflow-hidden aspect-[16/10] bg-[#F9F9FB]/40 w-full">
                <img 
                  src="/assets/governanca/confidencialidade.png" 
                  alt="Isolamento Absoluto" 
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
              </div>
              <!-- Text Container (40%) -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">01 / CONFIDENCIALIDADE</span>
                <h3 class="font-apple-display font-bold text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-primary tracking-[-0.03em] leading-tight mb-4">Isolamento Absoluto</h3>
                <p class="apple-proximity-text font-apple-text font-normal text-secondary text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Garantia contratual de sigilo. Suas minutas, petições e estratégias são processadas em ambiente fechado. Nossos modelos são privados: seus dados nunca treinam a IA.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 2: Blindagem (Texto Esq / Asset Dir) -->
          <div class="governanca-shelf apple-hardware-card p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-center">
              <!-- Text Container (40%) - Desktop Order 1 -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:order-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 font-apple-text tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">02 / BLINDAGEM</span>
                <h3 class="font-apple-display font-bold text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-primary tracking-[-0.03em] leading-tight mb-4">Blindagem de Hardware</h3>
                <p class="apple-proximity-text font-apple-text font-normal text-secondary text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Arquitetura criptográfica de nível bancário. Todas as comunicações e documentos digitais passam por chaves de segurança ponta a ponta, isolando o fluxo de dados do seu escritório contra qualquer vetor de invasão.
                </p>
              </div>
              <!-- Asset Container (60%) - Desktop Order 2 -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:order-2 apple-glass-image-card relative overflow-hidden aspect-[16/10] bg-[#F9F9FB]/40 w-full">
                <img 
                  src="/assets/governanca/blindagem.png" 
                  alt="Blindagem de Hardware" 
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Pilar 3: Ética (Asset Esq / Texto Dir) -->
