              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              Exportação de peças formatadas nas diretrizes estruturadas do CPC
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
