          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 pl-8">
            <button class="suggestion-chip text-left text-[10px] font-apple-text font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-primary bg-white hover:bg-slate-100/80 border border-slate-200/60 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-all shadow-2xs hover:shadow-xs active:scale-98 cursor-pointer">
              Como funciona o teste de 7 dias?
            </button>
            <button class="suggestion-chip text-left text-[10px] font-apple-text font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-primary bg-white hover:bg-slate-100/80 border border-slate-200/60 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-all shadow-2xs hover:shadow-xs active:scale-98 cursor-pointer">
              A IA atende às normas da OAB?
            </button>
            <button class="suggestion-chip text-left text-[10px] font-apple-text font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-primary bg-white hover:bg-slate-100/80 border border-slate-200/60 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 transition-all shadow-2xs hover:shadow-xs active:scale-98 cursor-pointer">
